#                  ^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>## @requirement replacesCompleteFileContents writeFile replaces the complete contents of the file at the given path with the given bytes, creating the file if it does not already exist.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
